---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import { brand } from '../config/brand';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About"
  description={`The story behind ${brand.name} — where it came from and where it's going.`}
>
  <Container class="py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold text-text-primary">About</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-secondary">
        {brand.name} was built by someone who has spent years watching education fail organizations —
        and spent just as long figuring out why.
      </p>

      <!-- Timeline -->
      <div class="mt-16 relative">
        <!-- Vertical line -->
        <div class="absolute left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-border"></div>

        <div class="space-y-12">
          <!-- Event 1 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-8">
            <div class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
              <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-accent bg-bg-primary ring-4 ring-bg-primary"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Enrollhand</p>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">The first education platform</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-text-secondary">
                Akis joined Enrollhand as an early employee and saw firsthand what it took to build
                education products for organizations. The insight: most platforms solve the wrong
                problem. They make it easy to upload content, not to achieve outcomes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Event 2 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-8">
            <div class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
              <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-accent bg-bg-primary ring-4 ring-bg-primary"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">WeSchool</p>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Scale and complexity</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-text-secondary">
                At WeSchool, Akis worked with some of Europe's largest organizations on their education
                programs. He saw what happened when programs were designed with rigor — and what happened
                when they weren't. The difference in outcomes was staggering.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Event 3 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-8">
            <div class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
              <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-accent bg-bg-primary ring-4 ring-bg-primary"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">Custom projects · 2019–2023</p>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Building the methodology</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-text-secondary">
                Over several years of custom education engagements, Akis developed a repeatable process
                for designing programs that actually move people. 100+ programs. 1M+ learners. 35+
                industries. The methodology was proven. What was missing was the right platform to run it at scale.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Event 4 -->
          <div class="relative flex gap-8">
            <div class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
              <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full border-2 border-accent bg-bg-primary ring-4 ring-bg-primary"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-2">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">{brand.name} · 2023</p>
              <h3 class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">Building what should exist</h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-text-secondary">
                {brand.name} was founded to combine the methodology with the platform. Not another LMS.
                Not another agency. A complete system: the software, the design process, and the team —
                all built around one goal: education that drives real outcomes.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</PageLayout>
